    "title": "Justin Verlander makes final career start as Tigers host Pirates - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By FLM ,\n21 hours ago Justin Verlander's last career appearance will come at the perfect place: Detroit. The rest of his final season didn't go as planned. The future Hall of Famer will start for the Tigers on Saturday afternoon against the Pittsburgh Pirates. Verlander, who announced this past summer that he would retire after the season, will make just his second start of the year. Read full article",
